---
permalink: /entries.json
layout: null
sitemap: false
---
{%- comment -%}
Structured index of every entry, for the compare view (assets/js/compare.js).

/search.json carries searchable TEXT; this file carries STRUCTURE — the schema's
own field list and group order, plus each entry's values keyed by field key. It
is generated entirely from `_data/schema.yml`, so a new field or a new group
appears in the compare table with no change here and none in the JavaScript.

Shape:
  { generated_at, site: {name}, entry: {singular, plural, path},
    groups:  [{key, title, description}],
    fields:  [{key, label, group, type, weight, facet, search, card,
               options?, short?, tone?}],
    entries: [{slug, url, title, summary, published, updated, featured,
               values: {key: value|[value]}, slugs: {facet key: [slug]}}] }

  short/tone   `option_meta` resolved per option value, emitted only where it
               differs from the default, so the client needs no schema logic.
  slugs        the same slugs `data-facet-<key>` carries on a catalog card, so a
               compare cell can link back into the filtered catalog.

Excluded on purpose: the write-up (`markdown`) and the media types (`image`,
`images`, `file`). A comparison is a document, not a gallery, and the body would
dwarf everything else — /search.json already indexes it.

Two Liquid-in-JSON rules this file lives by:
  - Every list that skips items is built with a LEADING comma and printed through
    `remove_first: ','` — the only trailing-comma-safe idiom when a `forloop` may
    `continue`.
  - A literal brace never touches a Liquid tag. Liquid's tokenizer ends a variable
    at `}}?` — ONE closing brace is enough — so a closing brace inside an output
    tag is a syntax error (even inside this comment). Braces are written as plain
    text with a space between them and the neighbouring tag.

Local assigns are prefixed `ej_`.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign ej_schema = site.data.schema -%}
{%- assign ej_cfg = site.data.site -%}
{%- assign ej_fields = ej_schema.fields | sort_by_weight
     | where_exp: "ej_wf", "ej_wf.type != 'markdown'"
     | where_exp: "ej_wf", "ej_wf.type != 'image'"
     | where_exp: "ej_wf", "ej_wf.type != 'images'"
     | where_exp: "ej_wf", "ej_wf.type != 'file'" -%}
{%- assign ej_groups = ej_schema.groups | groups_for: ej_fields -%}
{%- comment -%} The engine keys the compare view renders itself — the column header
carries title/summary/url and the dates — exactly the seed _layouts/entry.html uses
for `ent_shown` (schema contract §4). Declaring one of them as a schema field must
not put it in the table body a second time. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign ej_reserved = '|title|slug|summary|published|updated|thumbnail|featured|' -%}
{%- comment -%} An empty catalog (or one whose module is off) still emits a valid,
empty document, so the compare page's fetch never 404s on a fresh fork. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign ej_entries = site.data.entry_pages -%}
{%- unless ej_entries -%}{%- assign ej_entries = site.pages | where: 'layout', 'entry' -%}{%- endunless -%}
{%- assign ej_sort_key = ej_schema.entry.sort | default: 'published' -%}
{%- assign ej_entries = ej_entries | sort: ej_sort_key, 'first' -%}
{%- if ej_schema.entry.sort_order != 'asc' -%}{%- assign ej_entries = ej_entries | reverse -%}{%- endif -%}
{
"generated_at": {{ site.time | date_to_xmlschema | jsonify }},
"site": { "name": {{ ej_cfg.name | default: site.title | jsonify }} },
"entry": {
  "singular": {{ ej_schema.entry.singular | default: 'Entry' | jsonify }},
  "plural": {{ ej_schema.entry.plural | default: 'Entries' | jsonify }},
  "path": {{ ej_schema.entry.path | default: 'catalog' | jsonify }}
},
"groups": [
{%- capture ej_group_list -%}
  {%- for ej_g in ej_groups -%}
,{"key": {{ ej_g.key | jsonify }}, "title": {{ ej_g.title | jsonify }}{% if ej_g.description %}, "description": {{ ej_g.description | jsonify }}{% endif %}}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{{- ej_group_list | remove_first: ',' -}}
],
"fields": [
{%- capture ej_field_list -%}
  {%- for ej_f in ej_fields -%}
    {%- assign ej_fk = '|' | append: ej_f.key | append: '|' -%}
    {%- if ej_reserved contains ej_fk -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- assign ej_slot = ej_f | card_slot -%}
,{"key": {{ ej_f.key | jsonify }}, "label": {{ ej_f.label | jsonify }}, "group": {{ ej_f.group | default: 'other' | jsonify }}, "type": {{ ej_f.type | default: 'text' | jsonify }}, "weight": {{ ej_f.weight | default: 5 }}, "facet": {% if ej_f.facet %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}, "search": {% if ej_f.search %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}, "card": {% if ej_slot %}{{ ej_slot | jsonify }}{% else %}null{% endif %}
    {%- if ej_f.options -%}
      {%- capture ej_opt_list -%}{%- for ej_o in ej_f.options -%},{{ ej_o | jsonify }}{%- endfor -%}{%- endcapture -%}
, "options": [{{ ej_opt_list | remove_first: ',' }}]
      {%- capture ej_shorts -%}
        {%- for ej_o in ej_f.options -%}
          {%- assign ej_om = ej_f | option_meta: ej_o -%}
          {%- if ej_om.short != ej_o -%},{{ ej_o | jsonify }}: {{ ej_om.short | jsonify }}{%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endcapture -%}
      {%- if ej_shorts != '' -%}, "short": { {{ ej_shorts | remove_first: ',' }} }{%- endif -%}
      {%- capture ej_tones -%}
        {%- for ej_o in ej_f.options -%}
          {%- assign ej_om = ej_f | option_meta: ej_o -%}
          {%- if ej_om.tone != 'neutral' -%},{{ ej_o | jsonify }}: {{ ej_om.tone | jsonify }}{%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endcapture -%}
      {%- if ej_tones != '' -%}, "tone": { {{ ej_tones | remove_first: ',' }} }{%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{{- ej_field_list | remove_first: ',' -}}
],
"entries": [
{%- capture ej_entry_list -%}
  {%- for ej_e in ej_entries -%}
    {%- capture ej_vals -%}
      {%- for ej_f in ej_fields -%}
        {%- assign ej_fk = '|' | append: ej_f.key | append: '|' -%}
        {%- if ej_reserved contains ej_fk -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- assign ej_v = ej_e[ej_f.key] -%}
        {%- if ej_v == nil or ej_v == '' or ej_v == empty -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
,{{ ej_f.key | jsonify }}: {{ ej_v | jsonify }}
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture ej_slugs -%}
      {%- for ej_f in ej_fields -%}
        {%- unless ej_f.facet -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}
        {%- assign ej_v = ej_e[ej_f.key] -%}
        {%- if ej_v == nil or ej_v == '' or ej_v == empty -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- assign ej_vslugs = ej_v | slugify_list -%}
        {%- capture ej_slug_list -%}{%- for ej_s in ej_vslugs -%},{{ ej_s | jsonify }}{%- endfor -%}{%- endcapture -%}
,{{ ej_f.key | jsonify }}: [{{ ej_slug_list | remove_first: ',' }}]
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endcapture -%}
,{"slug": {{ ej_e.slug | default: ej_e.title | slugify | jsonify }}, "url": {{ ej_e.url | relative_url | jsonify }}, "title": {{ ej_e.title | jsonify }}, "summary": {{ ej_e.summary | default: '' | jsonify }}, "published": {{ ej_e.published | date: '%Y-%m-%d' | jsonify }}{% if ej_e.updated %}, "updated": {{ ej_e.updated | date: '%Y-%m-%d' | jsonify }}{% endif %}{% if ej_e.featured %}, "featured": true{% endif %}, "values": { {{ ej_vals | remove_first: ',' }} }, "slugs": { {{ ej_slugs | remove_first: ',' }} } }
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{{- ej_entry_list | remove_first: ',' -}}
]
}
